Additional notice (non-legal, for users of this project)

This software writes to boot partitions, /etc/fstab and the dpkg/apt hook
configuration of the host system. Incorrect use can render a machine
unbootable. It is provided for the OES / OES Plus hardware only. Always keep a
bootable USB recovery drive and a backup of your data before using the
migration, boot-switch or boot-layout features. See README.md §风险声明.
